(7251801, 1127008, 58634, '<td valign="top">I like the pose, idea and the vignette used but feel this cold be a bit brighter to add more detail and enhance the image all together.</td>', 'I like the pose, idea and the vignette used but feel this cold be a bit brighter to add more detail and enhance the image all together.', '2014-08-15 18:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
