(7252710, 1126979, 59029, '<td valign="top">Haha!  Ah Christophe, that sexy widow''s peak always gives you away :-)  Love the shoot notes and appreciate the sacrifice you had to make with hot wax dripping on you.  Also love the ''monster lighting'' - don''t think I''ve seen you use it before. Oh yes and congrats on the red - very fitting for this shot!!</td>', 'Haha!  Ah Christophe, that sexy widow''s peak always gives you away :-)  Love the shoot notes and appreciate the sacrifice you had to make with hot wax dripping on you.  Also love the ''monster lighting'' - don''t think I''ve seen you use it before. Oh yes and congrats on the red - very fitting for this shot!!', '2014-08-18 21:14:49.000000', NULL, 0),
